From bcc91a88b06ae70cd39f84e616d07e1f624c54d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: benrichard-amd <ben.richard@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 16:32:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gallium/ddebug: exclude ddebug from non-gfx builds

Move functions declared in dd_util.h from dd_draw.c into a new
dd_util.c. This allows dd_draw.c to move entirely into the
with_gfx_compute block alongside dd_context.c and dd_screen.c.

Fixes a link failure on ppc64le when building with decode-only VA.
---
 src/gallium/auxiliary/driver_ddebug/dd_draw.c |  77 ------------
 src/gallium/auxiliary/driver_ddebug/dd_util.c | 116 ++++++++++++++++++
 src/gallium/auxiliary/driver_ddebug/dd_util.h |   1 +
 src/gallium/auxiliary/meson.build             |   3 +-
 4 files changed, 119 insertions(+), 78 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/gallium/auxiliary/driver_ddebug/dd_util.c

